    "name": "The Cursed Deep",
    "steam_appid": 3581200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a High-Seas Adventure with &quot;The Cursed Deep&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enthralling virtual reality game that casts you as the defender of your own pirate ship navigating through mysterious, treacherous waters. Your mission: **fend off the mythical beasts that rise from the ocean's depths with only your wits and your cannons.**</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive VR experience, you'll feel the salt spray and the thrill of battle as you stand on the deck of your pirate ship, the sole line of defense against an unseen enemy lurking beneath the waves. With cannon at the ready, you'll load, aim, and fire in a desperate bid to survive the relentless assaults of the deep.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are invited to:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load and Fire:</strong> Man your ship's cannon and make every shot count as you face waves of monstrous adversaries rising from the deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense:</strong> Use your strategic skills to manage ammunition and time your reloads, keeping the enemies at bay as long as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical Seas:</strong> Navigate through fog-laden, uncharted waters filled with dark secrets and hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter the Unknown:</strong> Prepare for heart-pounding encounters with creatures of the deep, whose forms and abilities are obscured by the ocean's murky depths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Survive...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >long enough to tell tales of your bravery, or will your would be bounty pull you into the abyss? Set sail with &quot;The Cursed Deep&quot; for a VR gaming experience full of mystery and suspense, where your skills are tested against the overpowering dangers of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a High-Seas Adventure with &quot;The Cursed Deep&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enthralling virtual reality game that casts you as the defender of your own pirate ship navigating through mysterious, treacherous waters. Your mission: **fend off the mythical beasts that rise from the ocean's depths with only your wits and your cannons.**</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive VR experience, you'll feel the salt spray and the thrill of battle as you stand on the deck of your pirate ship, the sole line of defense against an unseen enemy lurking beneath the waves. With cannon at the ready, you'll load, aim, and fire in a desperate bid to survive the relentless assaults of the deep.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are invited to:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load and Fire:</strong> Man your ship's cannon and make every shot count as you face waves of monstrous adversaries rising from the deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense:</strong> Use your strategic skills to manage ammunition and time your reloads, keeping the enemies at bay as long as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystical Seas:</strong> Navigate through fog-laden, uncharted waters filled with dark secrets and hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter the Unknown:</strong> Prepare for heart-pounding encounters with creatures of the deep, whose forms and abilities are obscured by the ocean's murky depths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Survive...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >long enough to tell tales of your bravery, or will your would be bounty pull you into the abyss? Set sail with &quot;The Cursed Deep&quot; for a VR gaming experience full of mystery and suspense, where your skills are tested against the overpowering dangers of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dare to navigate 'The Cursed Deep', a gripping VR game where you command a pirate ship fending off the dreaded leviathans. Load cannons, aim true, and repel the monsters of the deep in this immersive test of skill and courage. Will you conquer the depths or be swallowed by the sea's fury?",
